ytpl - YouTube & YouTube Music playlist CLI
=============================================

ytpl manages YouTube and YouTube Music playlists through the official
YouTube Data API v3. Zero external dependencies. No browser cookies.

Platforms: macOS, Linux (Go 1.26+).

BUILD
-----

    go build -o ytpl ./cmd/ytpl

Or install directly:

    go install github.com/WyattJia/youtube-playlist-cli/cmd/ytpl@latest

AUTH
----

Enable YouTube Data API v3 in a Google Cloud project.

  * Desktop OAuth 2.0: required for private playlists and all writes.
  * API Key (optional): read-only access to public playlists by ID.

    ytpl auth import --client /path/to/client.json
    ytpl auth login
    ytpl whoami

    ytpl auth set-api-key --stdin < /path/to/api-key.txt

Note: OAuth apps in "Testing" expire refresh tokens after 7 days. Set
the consent screen to "In Production" (no verification needed for
personal use) and run `ytpl auth login` once.

USAGE
-----

    ytpl sync [--playlist ID] [--with-items]
    ytpl list [--remote]
    ytpl show PLAYLIST [--remote]
    ytpl create --title NAME [--privacy private|unlisted|public]
    ytpl update PLAYLIST [--title NAME] [--description TEXT] [--privacy P]
    ytpl delete PLAYLIST --yes
    ytpl add PLAYLIST VIDEO... [--file PATH] [--allow-duplicates]
    ytpl remove PLAYLIST [--item-id ID]... [--video VIDEO]...
    ytpl dedupe PLAYLIST [--keep first|last]
    ytpl reorder PLAYLIST (--move FROM TO | --by title|channel|added|reverse)
    ytpl export (PLAYLIST | --all) --out DIR [--format json|csv|txt]
    ytpl quota

All write commands accept --dry-run. Global flags: --state-dir, --json,
--api-key, --help, --version. Run `ytpl --help` for details.

QUOTA
-----

Default YouTube Data API v3 quota is 10,000 units/day (resets midnight
America/Los_Angeles). Reads cost 1 unit/page; writes cost 50 units each.
Batch migration (`ytpl migrate run`) reserves 500 units/day by default
and resumes across days automatically.

    ytpl migrate init --plan plan.json [--record record.json]
    ytpl migrate status
    ytpl migrate run [--dry-run] [--budget N] [--max-writes N]

TEST
----

    go vet ./...
    go test -race ./...

